          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q5. In the figure, 60° in an angle of symmetry. The figure has two angles of symmetry less then 60°. What is its smallest angle of symmetry?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.474,
            0.493,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The smallest angle of symmetry "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "= 2 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
