            0.115,
            0.691,
            0.65,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q7. This is a picture of the new Parliament Building in Delhi.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.719,
            0.882,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. Does the outer boundary of the picture have reflection symmetry? If so, draw the lines of symmetries. How many are they?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.764,
            0.884,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. Does it have rotational symmetry around its centre? If so, find the angles of rotational symmetry.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.808,
            0.883,
            0.872
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " a. Yes, the outer boundary of the picture has 3 lines of symmetry. b. Yes, the outer boundary has rotational symmetry. The angles of rotational symmetry are 120°, 240°, 360°."
            }
          ]
        },
